rrakesh Ali Ibn Yusuf "constructed his grand Mosque called Masjid al-Siqaya, \'Mosque of the Fountain.\' By the time that it was finished, it cost some 60,000 dinars, and was the largest of all the mosques that the Almoravids built throughout the empire." '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 944, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 815})
